{% comment %}
  base_path is intentionally relative (just site.baseurl, empty for this site) so that
  internal navigation/permalink/asset links stay on whatever host the visitor arrived on
  (joseph-rich.com OR joseph-rich-blog.vercel.app). Absolute, canonical-domain URLs are
  still emitted where external consumers require them — the canonical tag, RSS feed, and
  og:image/twitter:image (seo.html) and the social-share buttons (social-share.html) — via
  site.url directly, not base_path. See _config.yml `url`.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign base_path = site.baseurl %}